sequenceDiagram
    actor Player as Player (user)
    participant Quiz as Quiz (screen)
    participant Storage as localStorage (storage)
    participant Session as Quiz session (context)

    loop Each of 10 questions
        Quiz->>Storage: Read saved duration
        Note over Quiz: Use allowed value (3, 5, 7, 10, 15, 20) or default 15 and start countdown
        alt Answer before expiry
            Player->>Quiz: Select answer
            Quiz->>Session: Resolve with answer
        else Timer expires
            Quiz->>Session: Resolve as timeout
        end
        Note over Quiz,Session: Resolve once and ignore late events, stop timer, freeze choices
        Session-->>Quiz: Reveal correct answer and score only correct choices
        Player->>Quiz: Next
        Quiz->>Session: Advance, or finish after question 10
    end
